---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import { APP_URL } from '../lib/app-url';
---

<SiteLayout
  pageTitle="About"
  tagline="Providing free tools and resources for accountability"
  description="The Virtue Initiative is a non-profit that provides free, open source accountability tools. Read our mission and why we built Virtue."
>
  <section id="about">
    <h2>About</h2>

    <p>
      The Virtue Initiative is an organization that aims to provide free tools and resources for
      accountability. We currently offer a free screenshot-based accountability app and some
      resources on how to use it well.
    </p>

    <div class="about-callout">
      <p>
        Our mission is to develop free technology and resources to support people who want to be
        free from pornography. We know what it&apos;s like to feel stuck, and we want to provide
        tools to support you. We don&apos;t want the price to be yet another excuse not to deal with
        pornography.
      </p>
    </div>

    <p>
      Our vision is to see the Christian church and the world freed from pornography. There are
      billions of dollars made by keeping men and women stuck. For many people, it starts from a
      young age, and it&apos;s hard to give up, even if they desperately want to. We want to provide
      tools that support you and make it easier.
    </p>

    <p>
      The Virtue Initiative began in February 2026 when we started looking at accountability apps.
      There were a few options but none of them were free. We thought, &quot;What if we can make a
      free version while keeping most of the essential features of other paid services?&quot; Our
      goal is to fundraise all our financial support and keep the app free.
    </p>

    <p>
      Hopefully you&apos;re willing to join us on this mission. If you&apos;ve been or know someone
      who&apos;s been struggling to break free from porn, <a href={`${APP_URL}/signup`}>sign up</a> now
      or send this to them. You might also want to read <a href="/help/tips"
        >this page on tips to beat pornography</a
      >.
    </p>

    <p>
      If you wish to support us monetarily, you can <a href="/donate">donate</a>. If you have any
      questions, feel free to contact us at <a href="mailto:help@virtueinitiative.org"
        >help@virtueinitiative.org</a
      > or join our <a href="https://discord.gg/4kNsbRuzQD">Discord server</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>How can you help?</h2>

    <p>We are still early in the project, and there are a few practical things you can do to help.</p>

    <ol>
      <li>
        <strong><a href={`${APP_URL}/signup`}>Install the app</a></strong>. Even if you don&apos;t
        struggle with this, installing the app and giving us feedback is one of the most helpful
        things right now. We need to know what works well and what doesn&apos;t so that we can
        improve it.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong><a href="/donate">Donate</a></strong>. We are not a 501(c)(3) yet, so donations are
        not tax deductible. We are working toward 501(c)(3) status, but getting it is expensive
        (lawyers, filing fees, etc.). If you want and are able to support our mission, we could use
        some money to help get this off the ground.
      </li>
      <li>
        <strong>Tell others about the app</strong>. The core app is already mostly built. The
        biggest challenge is likely going to be helping people learn that there is a free option.
        We do not want cost to be the reason people do not take the first step, so tell them about
        it! Spread the word!
      </li>
    </ol>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>

<style is:global>
  #about h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2.8vw, 1.95rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    line-height: 1.12;
    color: var(--text);
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  #about p,
  #about li {
    font-size: 1.12rem;
    line-height: 1.85;
  }

  #about p + p {
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  #about h2 + p {
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  #about p + h2 {
    margin-top: 2.25rem;
  }

  #about ol {
    margin: 1rem 0 0;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
  }

  #about li + li {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }

  .about-callout {
    background: var(--bg-subtle);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
    border-radius: 0 0.5rem 0.5rem 0;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    margin: 1.25rem 0;
  }

  .about-callout p {
    font-size: 1.12rem !important;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--text) !important;
    margin-top: 0 !important;
    line-height: 1.85 !important;
  }
</style>
